  <diagram name="Page-1" id="SMWs-79BLJokrMyMlmnB">
    <mxGraphModel dx="5180" dy="3137" grid="0" gridSize="10" guides="1" tooltips="1" connect="1" arrows="1" fold="1" page="0" pageScale="1" pageWidth="827" pageHeight="1169" math="0" shadow="0">
      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart TB\n    subgraph ClientLayer [\&quot;1. Client / Presentation Layer\&quot;]\n        Player[\&quot;all-learner-ai-app (Port 3000)&lt;br/&gt;• React SPA / PWA&lt;br/&gt;• Game Mechanisms (SoundHunt, WordHunt, Bingo, Reading)&lt;br/&gt;• Audio Diagnostics &amp; Web Audio Recorder&lt;br/&gt;• Sunbird Telemetry Generator\&quot;]\n    end\n\n    subgraph GatewayAuth [\&quot;2. Identity &amp; Access Layer\&quot;]\n        AuthService[\&quot;axl-login-service / axl-login-service-x (Port 8000)&lt;br/&gt;• Express / Node.js&lt;br/&gt;• Nested JWE/JWS Token Generation (HS256 + A128CBC)&lt;br/&gt;• Session Registry &amp; Active Token Tracking&lt;br/&gt;• Virtual ID Resolution &amp; Student Management&lt;br/&gt;• Graduation &amp; Lifecycle Management\&quot;]\n    end\n\n    subgraph BusinessCore [\&quot;3. Core Platform Services Layer\&quot;]\n        OrchestrationService[\&quot;all-orchestration-service (Port 3009)&lt;br/&gt;• Express / TypeScript&lt;br/&gt;• Lesson Progress Tracker (addLesson, getLessonProgress)&lt;br/&gt;• Milestone State Machine (LLPPS Cycle)&lt;br/&gt;• Gamification Points System\&quot;]\n        \n        ContentService[\&quot;all-content-service (Port 3008)&lt;br/&gt;• NestJS / TypeScript&lt;br/&gt;• Multilingual Curriculum Repository (Letters, Words, Stories)&lt;br/&gt;• Level Content Mapping (B, m1 - m15)&lt;br/&gt;• Media &amp; Mechanism Metadata Delivery\&quot;]\n        \n        TelemetryMW[\&quot;all-telemetry-mw (Port 9001)&lt;br/&gt;• Express / Node.js&lt;br/&gt;• Sunbird Telemetry Standard (v1, v2, v3)&lt;br/&gt;• Real-time Event Validation &amp; Batch Ingestion&lt;br/&gt;• Dispatchers (MongoDB, ClickHouse, MySQL)\&quot;]\n    end\n\n    subgraph IntelligenceLayer [\&quot;4. Speech AI &amp; Evaluation Layer\&quot;]\n        LearnerAIService[\&quot;all-learner-ai-services (Port 3001)&lt;br/&gt;• NestJS / TypeScript&lt;br/&gt;• Pronunciation &amp; Fluency Engine&lt;br/&gt;• Grapheme-to-Phoneme Alignment&lt;br/&gt;• TOWRE Assessment Engine&lt;br/&gt;• Recommendation Engine Client\&quot;]\n        \n        TextEvalService[\&quot;all-learner-text-eval (Port 5001)&lt;br/&gt;• Python / Flask&lt;br/&gt;• RNNoise Audio Denoising&lt;br/&gt;• Praat Acoustic Prosody (Pitch, Intensity, Pauses)&lt;br/&gt;• WER, CER, WPM &amp; Reading Rate Computation\&quot;]\n    end\n\n    subgraph ExternalServices [\&quot;5. External AI &amp; Cloud Services\&quot;]\n        AI4Bharat[\&quot;AI4Bharat Dhruva API (EkStep)&lt;br/&gt;• Indian Language Conformer &amp; Whisper ASR&lt;br/&gt;• Returns Transcripts + nBestTokens Probabilities\&quot;]\n        MongoDB[(\&quot;MongoDB / Atlas&lt;br/&gt;• lesson_points_tracker&lt;br/&gt;• all_content_db&lt;br/&gt;• all_learner_ai&lt;br/&gt;• AXL-LOGIN-TE-TEST\&quot;)]\n        S3Bucket[(\&quot;Cloud Storage (AWS S3)&lt;br/&gt;• Frontend Web Hosting (CloudFront)&lt;br/&gt;• Audio Recordings &amp; Media Assets\&quot;)]\n    end\n\n    %% Client Interactions\n    Player --&gt;|\&quot;1. POST /api/v1/student/login\&quot;| AuthService\n    Player --&gt;|\&quot;2. GET /v1/content/:level/:lang\&quot;| ContentService\n    Player --&gt;|\&quot;3. POST /addLesson, GET /getLessonProgress\&quot;| OrchestrationService\n    Player --&gt;|\&quot;4. POST /scores/updateLearnerProfile (Audio)\&quot;| LearnerAIService\n    Player --&gt;|\&quot;5. POST /v3/telemetry (Events)\&quot;| TelemetryMW\n\n    %% Token Status Verifications\n    OrchestrationService -.-&gt;|\&quot;Verify Session Status\&quot;| AuthService\n    ContentService -.-&gt;|\&quot;Verify Session Status\&quot;| AuthService\n    LearnerAIService -.-&gt;|\&quot;Verify Session Status\&quot;| AuthService\n    TelemetryMW -.-&gt;|\&quot;Verify Session Status\&quot;| AuthService\n\n    %% Speech Pipeline\n    LearnerAIService --&gt;|\&quot;ASR Inference (WAV)\&quot;| AI4Bharat\n    LearnerAIService --&gt;|\&quot;RNNoise &amp; Praat Prosody\&quot;| TextEvalService\n    LearnerAIService --&gt;|\&quot;Fetch Target Content\&quot;| ContentService\n\n    %% Data Persistence\n    AuthService --&gt; MongoDB\n    OrchestrationService --&gt; MongoDB\n    ContentService --&gt; MongoDB\n    LearnerAIService --&gt; MongoDB\n    TelemetryMW --&gt; MongoDB\n    Player -.-&gt;|\&quot;Upload/Stream Audio\&quot;| S3Bucket\n\n&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="akLvHE5HhMrmsMF_afz0-1">
